            <description><![CDATA[<!doctype html><html lang="en"><meta charset="utf-8"><title>Connector 0.1.8</title><body><h1>Connector 0.1.8</h1><p>This update fixes a folder-access issue that could prevent saving documents in your Documents folder or its subfolders, even when manual saving in Hype worked.</p><ul><li>Corrected folder access for saving, opening, creating and exporting documents.</li><li>Clearer errors when a destination is refused before an operation starts.</li></ul><p>After updating Connector, save your work and restart Hype to load the updated plugin.</p></body></html>]]></description>
